AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0020337> "The constituent monomers need not be covalently attached in an end-to-end manner; that is, polymers with internal connections (e.g., polyubiquitin) can use this relation, as can circular polymers (e.g., plasmids) and multi-branched polymers (e.g., glycans). This relation, as non-transitive, allows one to indicate the number of instances of c.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0020337> "has_constituent_monomer")
